@ref s 593(2) (src:12707-12707)
GIVEN `two or more persons are charged in the same indictment with an offence referred to in subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person separately committed the offence in respect of the property or any part of it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 593(2) the person may be convicted` MEANS
    BRANCH
