        IF `the person separately committed the offence in respect of the property or any part of it` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any one or more of those persons who separately committed the offence in respect of the property or any part of it may be convicted"

